常世の闇に刻むプラトニックを
The platonic bond carved in everlasting darkness,

535
00:34:35,348 --> 00:34:39,048
分からせてあげる
I will make you understand.

536
00:34:39,048 --> 00:34:42,848
ほら 悲鳴を聞かせてよ保存
Come on, let me hear your screams.

537
00:34:42,848 --> 00:34:47,448
夢見ないで保存
Don't dream.

538
00:34:47,448 --> 00:34:51,048
ほら 聞かせて保存
Come on, let me hear them.

